# Airborne Ranger semantic function names — evidence-driven only.
# Format:  oldname  newname  [tnd]
#   untagged        = AR.EXE (lifted/ar.exe*.c, port/gen/ar.exe*.c, procs)
#   tagged 'tnd'    = TANDYSND.EXE overlay (prefixed tnd_ in port/gen + fmap)
# Applied in place by tools/rename.py. If a name's evidence is weak, leave
# the sub_/loc_/edummylabelN name — a wrong name is worse than no name.

